---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="The Need | Send Josh — Josh Montague, Training Leaders International"
  description="Josh Montague raises his own support as a US-based missionary with Training Leaders International. Learn how your church can pray, give, and send."
  path="/support/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">The need</p>
      <h1>Josh raises his own support.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;">Like every TLI missionary, Josh's ministry is funded entirely by churches and individuals who believe trained pastors are the greatest need of the global church.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">A letter from Josh</p>
      <!-- DRAFT: replace with Josh's own cover letter before launch -->
      <p>Dear friends,</p>
      <p>For fifteen years I had the privilege of pastoring local churches in Michigan and Wisconsin. For the last decade, I've had a different privilege: serving the pastors of the global church &mdash; men who shepherd growing congregations with no seminary, no library, and often no one to teach them how to study and preach the Scriptures.</p>
      <p>That work is now entering its most ambitious season yet: a three-year training partnership with sixteen pastors in the Philippines, with further partnerships being explored in Africa and Asia. I'm writing to ask you to consider sharing in it &mdash; through prayer, through financial partnership, and by sending your own people into the work.</p>
      <p>In Christ,<br />Josh Montague</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Three ways to partner</p>
      <h2>Pray. Give. Send.</h2>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <div>
          <h3 class="caps-head" style="font-size:1.05rem;">Pray</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.98rem;">Your prayers are always needed. Pray for wisdom and provision of funds and teachers, for the sixteen Filipino pastors, and for the six Pakistani pastors Josh walks with monthly toward ordination.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="caps-head" style="font-size:1.05rem;">Give</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.98rem;">Your financial support is crucial. Monthly partners sustain Josh's ministry year-round; one-time gifts help fund specific training trips. All gifts are tax-deductible and given through Training Leaders International.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="caps-head" style="font-size:1.05rem;">Send</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.98rem;">TLI training teams need qualified teachers. If your church has elders or seminary-trained men with a heart for the nations, talk to Josh about joining a future trip.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The budget</p>
        <h2>What the work requires.</h2>
        <p>Josh's annual support covers his family's living and ministry expenses as a full-time US-based missionary, plus the direct costs of overseas training: airfare, lodging, translation, and materials for each of the nine Philippines trips.</p>
        <!-- TODO: insert actual budget figures from Josh (monthly support goal, per-trip cost) -->
        <p>For a current summary of need and budget &mdash; including monthly support levels and per-trip sponsorship &mdash; email Josh directly. He'd be glad to walk your missions team through the details.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:josh.montague@trainingleaders.org">Request the budget summary</a>
      </div>
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="/images/josh-philippine-leaders.jpg" alt="Josh with Filipino church leaders" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="/images/josh-classroom-training.jpg" alt="US pastors teaching alongside Josh" loading="lazy" style="aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover;" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Go with Josh</p>
        <h2>Teach alongside him.</h2>
        <p>Josh doesn't travel and teach alone. Pastors and teachers from the US teach alongside him in the Philippines. If you're interested in going, reach out to Josh to find out more about training opportunities.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:josh.montague@trainingleaders.org">Ask about going</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center; max-width:760px;">
      <h2 class="caps-head">Give through TLI</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem;">All giving is processed by Training Leaders International. Choose &ldquo;Staff&rdquo; and designate your gift for <strong>Josh Montague</strong>.</p>
      <a class="btn-dark" href="https://trainingleadersinternational.org/give?tbl=staff" style="margin-top:16px;">Give now</a>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem; margin-top:20px; color:var(--muted);">All gifts are tax-deductible.<br />TLI is a member of the ECFA.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
